  "scope": "Share the safe suffix-zero argument",
  "validation": "Paired Variation and Assembly builds pass against refreshed current block, controller and Wang-plane providers; Assembly objects are identical. All six target declaration reports, 38,804 global simp entries and 16,567 instances match. Direct project provider source/object pairs match recorded receipts.",
  "limitations": [
    "The initial overlay used an older PackingBlocks object; a subsequent PackingCells build used an older WangPlane object. Both are superseded by the refreshed2 replay, and an intervening target attempt was interrupted and retained.",
    "The refreshed Assembly dependency closure still contains pre-adoption Pell, HalfBinomial and tiling/RunTrace objects; other transitive project and package providers remain cached. The replay is not a full current-source closure rebuild.",
    "Refreshed target user CPU was 58.88s baseline versus 32.11s final under shared load; earlier pairs show a similar direction, but these samples do not establish a general performance guarantee. The final client workspace-source sample predates adoption while its imported candidate object is phase-pinned."
  ],
